Post-Installation Setup for Metasploit Framework
================================================

Metasploit requires a PostgreSQL database to function optimally (for storing 
workspace data, hosts, services, and vulnerabilities).

After installing this package, you MUST initialize the database by running:

    $ msfdb init

This will automatically start the PostgreSQL service, create the 'msf' user, 
and initialize the databases.

To verify the database is connected, run:
    $ msfconsole
    msf6 > db_status

For more information, see: https://docs.metasploit.com/docs/using-metasploit/getting-started/setting-up-a-metasploit-database.html